792
00:46:01.092 --> 00:46:02.218
[pria] Apa itu tadi?

793
00:46:02.802 --> 00:46:04.553
[nafas gemetar] Sayang.

794
00:46:06.055 --> 00:46:08.849
Aku kehilangan anakku karenamu, Wooju?

795
